flowchart TD
  A["Admin 提交商品 + 规则"] --> B["PriceInferenceService 推断整数分价格区间"]
  B --> C{"AI_PROVIDER?"}
  C -->|mock| M["MockAiProvider deterministic 输出"]
  C -->|openai/ark| K{"API Key 配置?"}
